"backslash, i.e., ' and \\.<br>For more information, please see the "
"documentation on <a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/libpq-"
"connect.html#LIBPQ-CONNSTRING\" target=\"_blank\">libpq connection "
"strings</a>."
