#~ " parameter time limit is met.  An "
#~ "untimed (requested) checkpoint occur when "
#~ "the checkpoint_segments parameter is met, "
#~ "or when a superuser issues the "
#~ "CHECKPOINT command.  Frequent checkpointing "
#~ "can impose extra load on the "
#~ "server, but can reduce recovery time "
#~ "in the event of a crash or "
#~ "hardware failure."
